  ∴ REX › HELP                                    
──────────────────────────────────────────────────
               ‹ Session commands ›               
  ↑ more                                          
  :name [text]            rename selected (no     
                          text: open editor)      
  :rename <s> <slug>      change slug             
  :done [sel]             mark done               
  :undone [sel]           undo done               
  :uc :resume [sel]       undo done: unmark a     
                          running session, or     
                          resume an exited one    
  :rid [sel]              show the full resume    
                          id                      
  :undo [sel] [-turns N]  restore the folder to   
                          before the agent's      
